{
  "description": "Who settled a request (DEC-0081, project-comms.md#owner-settlement): a transition record `{op, from, to, observed?, settledBy?, summary?, principal?}` (a host journal document, not a receipt; settledBy is required on every complete and reconcile record) checked by kind `comms-transition`, FAC-SEM-027 (the lifecycle table) then FAC-SEM-109 (settlement attribution). `expect` lists `<code> <instancePath>` in that order. Characters are code points, as JSON Schema's maxLength counts them; strings compare as written (case matters); a null settledBy is present, not absent.",
